    "reviews": "\u201cIf you like Super Adventure Hand's humour and love platforming, you might as well get hands-on with this one and pick it up \u2014 you'll have 50 handcrafted levels to go through and plenty of fun to be ha(n)d.\u201d<br>9/10 \u2013 Game Grin<br><br>\u201cI really enjoyed my time with Super Adventure Hand. This is a physics puzzler with solid controls and entertaining bite-sized gameplay.\u201d<br>Liked-a-lot \u2013 Ladies Gamers<br><br>\u201cSuper Adventure Hand is a fun and quirky physics-based puzzle platformer.\u201d<br>8/10 \u2013 PS4 Blog<br>",
